71:                           configuration against a pattern and print the
72-                           substitution. Not supported on LLVM backend.
73:      --proof-hint         Generate proof hint instead of final configuration.
74-                           Ignores `--output`.
75:      --save-temps         Do not delete temporary files when krun terminates.
76-      --search             Search for all possible output states after
77-                           rewriting. Only supported on symbolic backends.
78-      --search-all         Like --search, but also return interim states
--
88-                           Timeout for calls to the SMT solver, in milliseconds
89-      --statistics         Print number of steps executed. Currently only
90-                           supported on LLVM backend.
91:      --term               Use the value that would otherwise be considered the
92:                           value for $PGM as the entire input configuration.
93:                           i.e., skip composing configuration from
94:                           configuration variables.
95-      --version            Print version of K
96-      --                   Interpret all arguments following as positional
97-                           arguments.

